CE4 PROJECT SUBMISSION
Registration Number: 25SSDS415071
Project: Crypto Mining Farm & Rig Performance Dashboard

CONTENTS
- crypto_mining_dashboard_final.py: Python Tkinter + SQLite application
- crypto_mining.db: SQLite database used by the application
- Crypto_Mining_Dashboard_Project_Report.docx: project documentation and viva questions
- ER_Diagram.png: database relationship diagram
- Screenshots/: seven screenshots showing the application tabs and test evidence

HOW TO RUN
1. Install Python 3 on Windows.
2. Keep the Python file and crypto_mining.db in the same folder.
3. Open a terminal in that folder.
4. Run: python crypto_mining_dashboard_final.py

The application uses Python's built-in sqlite3 and tkinter modules. Tkinter requires a desktop environment.

DATABASE CHECK
The supplied database was checked for SQLite integrity and foreign-key violations.
It contains one mining farm, one mining session and one hash reading (the Alpha Mining Farm sample record).
